Z||000000||the need for speed||10-17-2001||06:34 PM||||last night a drove to work and when I parked the fiero a heard a faint humming noise,after work when I got back to my car it was dead,I didn't leave anything on to drain the battary.I got a jump and when I got home and turned the car off I heard the noise again,I just jacked it up and the humm seems to be coming from the gas tank any ideas?||||reg||1
